            "review_title": "Review at Ginger Sapa Restaurant & Café",
            "review_text": "donnadanish\n138 contributions\n0\nOne of the BEST in Sapa!!\nFeb 2026 • Couples\nWe found this lovely restaurant on our last night in Sapa. We were welcomed by a beautiful young lady who made us feel right at home. We ordered both fresh and fried spring rolls and they were some of the best we've had in Vietnam!! We also ordered Cashew Shrimp which was absolutely delicious. Service was excellent and our lovely hostess also made a great MaiTai!! Highly recommend this restaurant! Wish we would have found them earlier in our stay. We would have gone back several times! Thank you for a great evening.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 9, 2026",
